config SENSEI_LINK
	bool "SENSEI link layer (framing and protobuf glue)"
	select NANOPB
	help
	  COBS and CRC-16 byte-stream framing, the SPI frame header, fragmentation, the nanopb helpers and
	  the SDK messages (lpwan.proto, types.proto). The generated sources are committed; the nanopb
	  runtime is the one of the NCS nanopb module (same commit as the SDK submodule, see README).
